Z||000005||Cozmo||06-07-2001||10:17 AM||||Go ahead and rub it in Roy, you suggested it first and I freaked... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">(guess I should listen to the "old heads").<BR>Just for that, you get to HELP!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">!!!<BR>The reason I haven't done it yet is I just got the Targa running again about a month ago.<BR>I'm going to suggest to the club at the next meeting that we have a "tech session" at my house.  Park both cars side by side and "go fer it".<BR>I'll supply beerz and bar-b-q, we'll take pics as we go along.<BR>||||reg||10
